# SYNTHETIC INPUT: nothing here is from the recording and nothing is the owner's input.
# Written by the planner on 12 October 2026 (decision recorded in NOTES.md, 00:47): the click
# that starts a new campaign game (the section of new-game.script, unchanged), then ONE tap
# of the space bar on the loading screen, which the game holds until a key comes.
#
#   GATE3_INPUT_SCRIPT=gate3/synthetic/continue.script build/gate3/gate3 run
#
# How the key was found: scout-load-key (docs/scout/load-key.md) tried space, Enter, Esc, E
# and W, one a run, from the kept save.  With the other four the UI still listed
# LoadingProgress 1,400 Presents into the mission's frames; after the space bar the panel is
# gone, the client's HUD panels are listed (CBaseViewport, CHudScriptElements, ...) and the
# device's calls per Present change (run `sp`, NOTES.md, 12 October 01:2x).
#
# Times are milliseconds after the anchor fired.

anchor mark main-menu          # the UI's script opened menu_MainMenu (gate3/run.c, THE MENU MARK)

# Click 1: MainMenuPanel/ButtonRow0x0, label #MENU_NEW_GAME (see new-game.script).
3000 moveto 375 577
3400 button left down
3480 button left up

anchor mark mission-frame      # the first Present with the mission's world in it

# The space bar (virtual key 32; scan code from the runtime's US table), 5 s into the
# loading screen's hold.
5000 key down 32
5120 key up 32
